/// Complete 78-card Rider-Waite-Smith dataset:
/// 22 Major Arcana (Golden Dawn elemental attributions) + 56 Minor Arcana.
/// Each card carries archetype keywords, one-sentence upright/reversed
/// psychological meanings and one sharp Socratic question.
